### A06 전체 메뉴
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/menus

### A07 메뉴 상세
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/menus/1

### A08 메뉴 등록
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/menus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "new drinks",
  "price": 4000,
  "description": "새로운 커피"
}

### A09 일반 메뉴 수정
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/menus/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 2,
  "name": "old drinks",
  "price": 4500,
  "description": "새롭지 않은 커피"
}

### A10 메뉴 삭제
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/menus/5

### A11 주문 접수 - 응답의 id 를 아래 {id} 자리에 쓴다
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"buyer@example.com","address":"서울시 실습로 10 101호","postcode":"01234","items":[{"menuId":1,"quantity":2},{"menuId":2,"quantity":1}]}

### A12 이메일별 주문 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?email=buyer@example.com

### A13 주문 상세
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1

### A16 주문 취소
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1/cancel

### A19 판매 중 메뉴
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/menus/available

### A20 메뉴명 검색
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/menus/search?keyword=Sidamo

### A21 판매 여부 변경
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/menus/1/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available" : false
}

### A22 주문 메모 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1/memo
Content-Type: application/json


{"memo":"문 앞에 놓아주세요"}

### A23 재주문
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1/reorder





###입력오류(400) (A08 메뉴 등록시 price가 1000000을 넘겼을 때)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/menus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "new drinks",
  "price": 10000001,
  "description": "새로운 커피"
}

### 이메일 형식 오류 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"not-an-email","address":"서울시 실습로 10 101호","postcode":"01234","items":[{"menuId":1,"quantity":1}]}




###대상 없음(404)(A07 메뉴 상세, 없는 번호 조회)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/menus/999999




### 배송지 불일치 (409) - 같은 이메일, 같은 배송일, 다른 주소
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"buyer@example.com","address":"부산시 다른길 99","postcode":"01234","items":[{"menuId":1,"quantity":1}]}


###